=== limitations / failure modes ===
- Counting only the winner as N=1 inflates DSR — always use ALL trials.
- Joining final revisions as day-0 is look-ahead (rev_final_LEAK foil).
- Paper validates wiring/recon/kills — not alpha.
- Grading rubric scores honesty/engineering, not whether SR>0.

